/ Hash-shaped flash[:error] payloads come from form-validation failures and
/ are rendered field-by-field by _validation_errors.slim on the form view.
/ This bar only handles string-shaped errors (e.g. "Our servers are not responding").
- if flash[:error] && !flash[:error].is_a?(Hash)
  div class="alert alert-danger" id="flash_bar_danger"
    = flash[:error]
- if flash[:notice]
  div class="alert alert-success" id="flash_bar_success"
    = flash[:notice]
